# Conformance probe pack for `ascii` and `chars` under `bit_order msb-lsb`
# (spec 0.22, ruling 3: each byte or character is read as `uint` reads a field
# of its width at its place). Public. No kinds. Bit order msb-lsb (spec 0.22): positions count from the
# high bit of each byte, a value is assembled from its first bit up.
#
#   bytes 0..1    label  ascii, two characters
#   bits 16..22   tag    chars:ascii7, one character
format     conformance-long-mlsb-text
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.label  0:0:16  ascii
field   probe.tag    0:16:7  chars:ascii7
